{"parse": {"title": "FP-07", "pageid": 64906, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FP-06\" title=\"FP-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FP-07</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B5.B7.E5.B2.AC.E5.B0.BD.E5.A4.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"海岬尽头\">海岬尽头</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 海岬尽头</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Edge of the Cape</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>沉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蓝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191607</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hegang_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hegang_ye\"><img alt=\"hegang_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-hegang_ye.png/600px-Cg-hegang_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-hegang_ye.png/900px-Cg-hegang_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-hegang_ye.png/1200px-Cg-hegang_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜幕降临，挖掘艺术坐在河畔的长凳上，手里拿着廉价的快餐盒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>食物塞满了他的口腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嚼嚼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>难道是苏菲亚的神秘术能够逆转时间？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>还是……眼前的一切，只是我自以为是的幻觉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>汪汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦……小狗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>动物湿漉漉的眼睛紧盯着叉子上的肉块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>吃吧，吃吧——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>静谧的夜晚，暗紫色的天幕边，启明星正不断地闪烁着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>不论如何，我还是回到了这里……没有陌生的语言、陌生的教条……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>接下来，我应当去继续宣扬我的艺术，为那些追寻“爱与和平”的人而发声……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>但是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他罕见地陷入了沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜风乍起，一张揉皱的海报，被吹拂到了他的脚边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>“一场盛大的艺术集会，即将在卡纳比街举行！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>“史无前例的神秘学盛宴，绝无仅有的壮阔游行……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>“反对战争，反对一切！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夸张的宣传语引起了他的兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦！是的，我需要做得更多——相比起语言，人们还是愿意相信切实的行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这正是需要我的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他擅长这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有的一切都无需准备，熟极而流、顺理成章。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kanabijie2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kanabijie2\"><img alt=\"kanabijie2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/600px-Cg-kanabijie2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/900px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-kanabijie2.png/1200px-Cg-kanabijie2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>伦敦需要天马行空的艺术派对，需要能让所有人发声的文化集市……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>伦敦属于乌托邦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我会办一场让更多人都乐在其中的盛会，届时我们的理想将会成为各大报刊与新闻记者的宠儿，一场新的主流。所有人都会了解它，然后爱上它！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数的泡泡飞扬在空气之中，在日光下，它们反射出七彩的光线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梦幻般的憧憬在其中绽放。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>所有人都会看到那个世界……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>没有暴力，没有仇恨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他沉浸在自我的狂热之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个哗众取宠的艺术家，一个狭隘的自我主义者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个制造镜面肥皂泡，导致交通瘫痪的罪魁祸首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到一辆汽车疾驰而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汽车：</div><div>滴滴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一脚刹车，可惜为时太晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艺术家单薄的躯体高高飞起，重重落下。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dilao1\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dilao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惊慌的叫喊在岩壁之间回响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他猛地坐了起来，颤抖的手擦掉了额际的冷汗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>呼——呼——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这竟然只是一个梦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我连报纸的标题都想好了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>《先驱艺术家离世——为“爱与和平”》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……嗯，也有可能是《混乱的制造者离世 伦敦重获安宁》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>如果幸运的话，他们也许还会附上一些我的思想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他偶尔也会羡慕那些名流，他们只要说话，自会有人替他们传播思想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他起身，险些被布料绊倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢，小岛的衣服——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我应该穿上它，然后再逃出这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>离开这座岛屿，离开重塑之手，离开所有的组织和阶级，继续我的艺术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他换上了洁白的布袍。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dilao2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dilao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>逃出洞壁的过程顺利得不可思议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有的险关隘道都无人把守。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯……那些人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>难道都去上数学课了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你还不走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术深吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>您好，我的兄弟姐妹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们沐浴在阿波罗之星的光辉之下，遵守固定的节律，以平衡过度的灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的演技小有所成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>所以，您能为我指示渡口的方向吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我想要，嗯……去现实世界，寻找那些……呃……碎屑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>我没明白你说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>但你如果想离开这儿，可以和我们一起走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>太好了……您一定是一位很慷慨的数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教众流露出了古怪的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>我们没有数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>聚集在这里的，都是一些分数，或者压根没有发现灵魂数字的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>所以我们要离开这个地方——这个只有整数才能以完全的权利生存着的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们的想法完全一致！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>很难得在这个小岛上找到同好……所以，我们现在要去哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>向前走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>一名女士承诺过我们……她说，一名使者会在前方接应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-510801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>就在海岬的尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>带上我，请带上我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/HeadIconSmall-563601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……我相信，艺术还没有死！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FP-07"}}